          "title": "You'll want to know: مرجع",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مرجع — marjiʿ — \"a reference\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هذا القاموس مرجع مهم. hādhā al-qāmūs marjiʿ muhimm. This dictionary is an important reference."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: مراجع, marājiʿ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مرجع (marjiʿ) is built on the native Arabic root r-j-ʿ, \"to return, to go back\" (Lane). Marjiʿ is a noun of place, a place one goes back to: a reference."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
