              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اقتبس (iqtabasa) is built on the native Arabic root q-b-s, \"to take fire from\" (Lane). Lane gives the root for taking a flame from a fire, and also for taking knowledge: Form VIII came to mean to quote."
